    57	`DepthK` other than 2 and 5, and nothing about `Delta` values other
    58	than 3 and 6; the observation that the instance needs `Delta ≥ DepthK`
    59	for shipping to be reachable is a constraint on future instances and
    60	is entered on the reading aid.
